| Dataset | Source | Coverage |
|---|---|---|
| `WorldBank.xlsx` | World Bank Open Data | 1960–2018 · 12,449 records · 15 indicators |
| `HDI.csv` | UN Human Development Reports | 1990–2021 · 206 countries · 1,008 columns |
