## Business Questions Answered (In Priority Order)

### 1. Population & GDP Growth — Is There Overlap?
- **Top GDP grower:** Equatorial Guinea (+145,881%) — driven by oil discovery
- **Top population grower:** UAE (+9,455%) — driven by migration
- **Overlap:** Qatar appears in **both** top 10 lists — the only country with explosive growth in both metrics

### 2. Which Regions Grew HDI Most in the 21st Century?
- **Sub-Saharan Africa (SSA):** +24.5% HDI growth since 2000 — highest globally
- **South Asia:** +24.0% — second highest
- All regions experienced a **COVID-19 dip in 2020**, confirming fragility of development gains

### 3. Which Factors Are Most Correlated with Life Expectancy?

| Factor | Correlation | Direction |
|---|---|---|
| Infant mortality | –0.94 | Negative — strongest predictor |
| Birth rate | –0.88 | Negative |
| Death rate | –0.84 | Negative |
| Internet access | +0.60 | Positive |
| Electricity consumption | +0.54 | Positive |
| GDP per capita | +0.52 | Positive |
| Unemployment | +0.01 | Almost no effect |

### 4. What Differentiates High vs Low Income Countries?

| Indicator | Low Income | Upper Middle Income |
|---|---|---|
| Life expectancy | 49 years | 66 years |
| Infant mortality | 106 per 1,000 | 41 per 1,000 |
| GDP per capita | $355 | $3,210 |
| Internet users | 3% | 19% |

