## 3 Actions for IDA Leadership

| # | Insight | Recommended Action |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Infant mortality (–0.94 correlation) is the single biggest threat to life expectancy | Prioritise maternal & infant health funding immediately |
| 2 | SSA & South Asia are rising fast but remain fragile | Increase IDA allocation to both regions |
| 3 | Internet & electricity outperform GDP as development predictors | Fund digital & energy infrastructure in low income nations |

